      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "ESTABLISHMENT OF AN AUDIT COMMITTEE FOR THE CITY OF NEW YORK\nBY THE POWER VESTED IN ME AS MAYOR OF THE CITY OF NEW YORK,\nit is hereby ordered:",
